msgid ""
"`findfmt` 1.1 is a minor release with a few intentional, visible changes "
"since 1.0.x. Most users only need to check the Python version they run "
"on. If you parse `findfmt` output, call it from scripts, or use the "
"Python API, read the sections that apply to you."
